cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Chinese Furry Convention Dataset, 2015-2027"
abstract: >-
  A census of 511 furry-fandom events held in mainland China, Hong Kong and
  Taiwan between 2015 and 2027 - dates, cities, venues, organisers and size
  tiers - as a snapshot taken on 2026-10-17. Collected from FEC 兽展日历
  (furrycons.cn), a community-maintained calendar. Contains no attendance
  figures; the size tier is the source's own estimate.
authors:
  - name: "圈层观察员"
    affiliation: "Independent researcher"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-18"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - furry fandom
  - subculture
  - conventions
  - China
  - event calendar
  - 兽圈
  - 兽展
repository-code: "https://github.com/qweqwe777/furry-conventions-cn"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23448131"
    description: "Concept DOI - always resolves to the latest version."
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23448132"
    description: "Version DOI of v1.0.0 - resolves to exactly those bytes."
